Thanks for all of your help. It works like a charm, but I found one other issue I was having when I tried to run this using a fileInput, instead of an already available dataframe. Basically the inFile portion should have looked like this:

  inFile = reactive({

    if(input$go<1)
      return()

    x <- input$file1

    if (is.null(x) == TRUE){
      return(NULL)
    }

### Added portion
    if (is.null(x) == FALSE){
      Raw.Results = read.csv(x$datapath, header=TRUE)
    }

    Raw.Results

  })

THanks again.

