It's not currently possible to use file uploads in conditionalPanel conditions, sorry. You could perhaps create an output on the server to proxy this for you:

# in server.R
output$fileUploaded <- reactive({
  return(!is.null(input$file1))
})

Then your conditionalPanel condition could be "output.fileUploaded".

