The server block does NOT belong in /etc/init/shiny-server.conf; that is an Upstart config file, not a Shiny Server config file. Sorry, this is very confusing.

Instead, you want to create a separate file under /etc/shiny-server/shiny-server.conf, and put the server block in there.

